{"reference":"1 Chronicles 24","book":"1 Chronicles","chapter":24,"status":"pending","sections":[{"kind":"surrounding_passages","title":"A Note on the Surrounding Lists","blocks":[{"id":"block_1","text":"The detailed orders of Levites, musicians, and administrators in the surrounding chapters may preserve earlier traditions while also reflecting and authorizing later temple institutions. This historical picture is disputed, so these lists should not be read as an uncomplicated record of a single moment in David’s reign.","verse_refs":["1 Chronicles 23:1-32","1 Chronicles 25:1-31","1 Chronicles 26:1-32","1 Chronicles 27:1-34"],"provenance_refs":["reader_path_1_chronicles_024_779e1605f486e12d70372fe5"],"confidence":"medium","interpretation_level":"disputed"}]}],"generated_metadata":null}